  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CoS RRM 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SvK RRM 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim is to support minor humanitarian interventions through the ACT    alliance (Action of Churces Together) as a preparedness measure and a fast track funding arragement to meet immediate humanitarian needs of victims of sudden disasters. Expected results are that the CoS        delivers required emergency assistance to the affected populations,   in priority the most vulnerable. January 2010 to December 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja sm&#xe4;rre humanit&#xe4;ra insatser genom ACT alliansen    som en mekanism f&#xf6;r att vara f&#xf6;rberedd och snabbt kunna skjuta till   medel n&#xe4;r omedelbara humanit&#xe4;ra behov hos m&#xe4;nniskor som har drabbats  av snabbt uppkomna humanit&#xf6;ra kriser. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat &#xe4;r att SvK  skall snabbt kunna leverera katastrofhj&#xe4;lp till drbbade befolkningar, fr&#xe4;mst de svagaste.januari 2010 - december 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
